message: "If you use or refer to this work, please cite the Core Ontology as below."
type: dataset
title: "Evertophy: an independent research programme toward a theory of everything"
abstract: >-
  Public record of the Evertophy research programme: the Core Ontology
  (canonical Turkish minor16 and English Minor03), the V23 and V24 rolling
  master documents, and the Lean 4 formal verification archive (269 theorems).
  Evertophy proposes a three-phase ontology of reality (c0 black holes,
  Cm matter, measurement and time, c+ dark sector and vacuum) as a common
  language for General Relativity, quantum mechanics, the Standard Model and
  cosmology. Numerical-prediction counter: 0/10.
